---
import ThemeImage from '../components/ThemeImage.astro';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Arrow from '../components/Arrow.astro';
---
<Layout title="Our Story | Mannath Real Estate, UAE" description="Meet Mannath: a UAE real estate brand built around considered spaces, personal attention and the belief that the right home changes how you live.">
<section class="page-intro section"><span class="eyebrow">OUR STORY</span><h1>A fresh perspective.<br/>A personal <em>connection.</em></h1><div class="page-intro-bottom"><p>We believe the most meaningful address<br/>is the one that feels like you.</p><span>ROOTED IN THE UAE</span></div></section>
<div class="wide-image"><ThemeImage src="/images/interior.jpg" alt="Light-filled contemporary interior with warm, natural finishes" width="1800" height="900" fetchpriority="high"/><span>SPACES WITH MEANING. POSSIBILITIES WITH PURPOSE.</span></div>
<section class="intro section"><div data-reveal><span class="eyebrow">WHY MANNATH</span><h2>More than a place.<br/><em>A sense of belonging.</em></h2></div><div class="intro-copy" data-reveal><p>Real estate begins with a place. For us, it begins with a person.</p><p>Mannath is a UAE-based real estate brand with a simple philosophy: understand the life someone wants to build, then help them discover the space to build it.</p><p>Whether you’re imagining a new home, exploring a different neighbourhood, or considering your next property move, our approach starts with your priorities.</p></div></section>
<section class="values-section section"><span class="eyebrow" data-reveal>WHAT GUIDES US</span><div class="values-grid">{[{number:'01',title:'People before property',text:'We make room for your questions, your preferences, and your plans. The right conversation comes before the right address.'},{number:'02',title:'Clarity at every step',text:'A considered decision starts with understanding. We value straightforward communication and thoughtful, practical guidance.'},{number:'03',title:'An eye for the exceptional',text:'We see the details that make a place distinctive — its proportions, its surroundings, and the way it fits into everyday life.'}].map(v=><article data-reveal><span>{v.number}</span><h3>{v.title}</h3><p>{v.text}</p></article>)}</div></section>
<section class="destination section"><div class="destination-heading" data-reveal><span class="eyebrow">OUR HOME, YOUR POSSIBILITY</span><h2>Inspired by the UAE.<br/><em>Shaped around you.</em></h2><p>The UAE brings together ambition and belonging, extraordinary architecture and everyday moments. It is the setting for our story — and perhaps the beginning of yours.</p><a href="/contact/" class="text-link">Tell us what you have in mind <Arrow/></a></div><div class="destination-image" data-reveal><ThemeImage src="/images/dubai.jpg" alt="Dubai architecture rising above the city" width="1200" height="1400" loading="lazy"/><div>A SENSE OF PLACE<small>United Arab Emirates</small></div></div></section>
<section class="cta-section" data-reveal><span class="eyebrow">GOOD THINGS BEGIN WITH HELLO</span><h2>Your story.<br/><em>Our next conversation.</em></h2><a class="button button-cream" href="/contact/">Let’s connect <Arrow/></a></section>
</Layout>
